[{"id":161755593,"discussion_id":"89ddd28199a5bbaadc5660bdde5fbc26425f5209","body":"\nThanks for your pull-request.\n\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC).\n\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-transformer/sig-info.yaml)\n","created_at":"2026-01-30T15:46:52+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-30T15:46:52+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161755604,"discussion_id":"484bbcb350f21f583c846f0ab34bfd626debd817","body":"以下是根据您提交的修改文件推荐的Reviewer和Committer序列，需各模块评审通过后方可合入\n| Module List | Reviewers | Committers |\n|-------|-------|-------|\n| gmm     | N/A    | [*wenxin_fight*](https://gitcode.com/wenxin_fight), [*chaotang233*](https://gitcode.com/chaotang233), [*chen-linxin4*](https://gitcode.com/chen-linxin4), [*liudan12*](https://gitcode.com/liudan12), [*Allan_Yu*](https://gitcode.com/Allan_Yu)    |\n","created_at":"2026-01-30T15:46:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-30T15:46:54+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161755660,"discussion_id":"ac20cae0b126639122e3320645b3f6fee6bf4e1c","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-01-30T15:47:02+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-30T15:47:02+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161755729,"discussion_id":"dee4707975b9f39888c809478537c71ddd8e22c0","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR旨在优化分组矩阵乘与SwiGLU激活后量化算子（A8W4）的向量计算内核。核心问题是原实现中存在冗余的硬件事件同步和低效的数据流管理，导致不必要的指令开销和计算效率瓶颈。通过重构同步与数据管理逻辑，以提升整体计算性能。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改方案聚焦于重构向量计算后处理流程。主要措施包括：在`MulPertokenScale`函数中，移除冗余的`SetFlag`/`WaitFlag`操作，统一使用`PipeBarrier<PIPE_V>()`进行同步；在`Swiglu`函数中，移除不必要的张量入队操作，同样采用管道屏障确保数据一致性；在`Quant`函数中，简化数据流路径，移除对中间结果队列的依赖，直接利用已存在的局部张量进行计算。整体上通过减少同步点和优化数据流来降低指令开销。","created_at":"2026-01-30T15:47:20+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-30T15:47:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161768654,"discussion_id":"49245a13d892d11fc998e8ce618bb3fed1dff3e1","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-01-30T16:37:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-01-30T16:37:19+08:00","user":{"id":"687e1fcd0b80e6291e89dbf4","login":"Wei_NaChuan","object_id":"687e1fcd0b80e6291e89dbf4","name":"weinachuan","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/Wei_NaChuan"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":161768788,"discussion_id":"894a31040da62c464eef73312bb1c41fc241cadf","body":"流水线任务触发成功 [<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=0d4f52bd3a